#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:1
msgid "Build a project theme"
msgstr "制作项目主题"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:4
msgid ""
"A theme gives the same content two reading forms: a website and a book. "
"This tutorial builds an Orbit theme with a shared visual identity, an "
"HTML partial and macro, and a modular PDF template. It needs no plugin or "
"compiler."
msgstr ""
"主题让同一份内容既成为网站，也成为书籍。本教程制作 Orbit 主题，统一视觉风格，使用 HTML 局部模板和宏，并拆分 PDF "
"模板。不需要插件或编译器。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:8
msgid "1. Start with a real project"
msgstr "1. 从真实项目开始"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:11
msgid ""
"Use Guidedog 0.6.2 or newer. Run this from the directory that will "
"contain ``orbit``:"
msgstr "使用 Guidedog 0.6.2 或更新版本。在准备创建 ``orbit`` 的父目录运行："

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:17
msgid ""
"Rename the generated ``orbit/_templates/book.typ`` to ``base-book.typ`` "
"in the same directory. Keep this file: it supplies the tested page "
"layout, cover, running heads, contents, code styles and optimized "
"paragraph breaking."
msgstr ""
"将生成的 ``orbit/_templates/book.typ`` 在同一目录内重命名为 "
"``base-book.typ``。保留它：页面布局、封面、页眉、目录、代码样式和优化断行都由此模板提供。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:21
msgid ""
"Download :download:`conf.toml <../_static/repository/theme/conf.toml>`, "
":download:`index.rst <../_static/repository/theme/index.rst>` and "
":download:`reading.rst "
"<../_static/repository/theme/chapters/reading.rst>`. Save the first two "
"in ``orbit`` and the third in ``orbit/chapters``. The finished project "
"will have these files:"
msgstr ""
"下载 :download:`conf.toml "
"<../_static/repository/theme/conf.toml>`、:download:`index.rst "
"<../_static/repository/theme/index.rst>` 和 :download:`reading.rst "
"<../_static/repository/theme/chapters/reading.rst>`。前两份保存到 "
"``orbit``，第三份保存到 ``orbit/chapters``。完成后的文件结构如下："

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:45
msgid "2. Set the contract"
msgstr "2. 设定契约"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:48
msgid ""
"The downloaded configuration selects the local template and static "
"directories. ``html_css_files`` adds our stylesheet after the default "
"stylesheet. ``html_context`` supplies a project value to Jinja. The "
"explicit PDF filename makes the output easy to find."
msgstr ""
"下载的配置指定本地模板和静态文件目录。``html_css_files`` 在默认样式表之后添加主题 CSS；``html_context`` 向 "
"Jinja 传入项目值。显式指定 PDF 文件名，便于查找输出。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:55
msgid "orbit/conf.toml"
msgstr "orbit/conf.toml"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:57
msgid ""
"All paths in this tutorial are project files. HTML templates are found "
"through ``templates_path``. The PDF entry point is always "
"``_templates/book.typ`` under the source directory; changing "
"``templates_path`` does not move it."
msgstr ""
"本教程中的路径都是项目文件。HTML 模板通过 ``templates_path`` 查找。PDF 入口固定为源目录中的 "
"``_templates/book.typ``，修改 ``templates_path`` 不会移动它。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:61
msgid "3. Extend the HTML layout"
msgstr "3. 扩展 HTML 布局"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:64
msgid ""
"Save :download:`layout.html "
"<../_static/repository/theme/_templates/layout.html>` as "
"``orbit/_templates/layout.html``. Replace the generated file completely:"
msgstr ""
"将 :download:`layout.html "
"<../_static/repository/theme/_templates/layout.html>` 保存为 "
"``orbit/_templates/layout.html``，完整替换生成的文件："

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:69
msgid "orbit/_templates/layout.html"
msgstr "orbit/_templates/layout.html"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:71
msgid ""
"``!layout.html`` selects Guidedog's built-in layout. Without ``!``, a "
"template named ``layout.html`` would try to extend itself. ``super()`` "
"keeps the parent's block content. Navigation, search, theme controls and "
"accessible landmarks remain in the base layout. Our blocks add a label, "
"metadata and an edition footer."
msgstr ""
"``!layout.html`` 选择 Guidedog 内置布局。没有 ``!`` 时，名为 ``layout.html`` "
"的模板会试图继承自己。``super()`` 保留父块内容。导航、搜索、主题控件和无障碍地标都留在基础布局中；我们的块只添加标签、元数据和版本页脚。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:76
msgid ""
"A theme changes presentation. A build plugin changes source text, "
"complete HTML or generated assets. Use :doc:`../plugins` when a template "
"cannot express the required operation. Ordinary layout changes need no "
"native code."
msgstr ""
"主题改变呈现；构建插件改变源文本、完整 HTML 或生成资源。模板无法表达所需操作时，参见 "
":doc:`../plugins`。一般布局修改不需要原生代码。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:80
msgid "4. Give repeated markup one home"
msgstr "4. 复用重复的标记"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:83
msgid ""
"Create ``orbit/_templates/macros`` and ``orbit/_templates/partials``. "
"Save :download:`ui.html "
"<../_static/repository/theme/_templates/macros/ui.html>` and "
":download:`edition.html "
"<../_static/repository/theme/_templates/partials/edition.html>` at the "
"matching paths:"
msgstr ""
"创建 ``orbit/_templates/macros`` 和 ``orbit/_templates/partials``，将 "
":download:`ui.html "
"<../_static/repository/theme/_templates/macros/ui.html>`、:download:`edition.html "
"<../_static/repository/theme/_templates/partials/edition.html>` 保存到对应路径："

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:90
msgid "orbit/_templates/macros/ui.html"
msgstr "orbit/_templates/macros/ui.html"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:94
msgid "orbit/_templates/partials/edition.html"
msgstr "orbit/_templates/partials/edition.html"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:96
msgid ""
"A macro takes explicit inputs. An included partial uses the current "
"page's context. Escape plain project values with ``|e``. Use ``pathto`` "
"for document links: a hard-coded ``chapters/reading.html`` would break on "
"a nested page or with another HTML builder."
msgstr ""
"宏接收明确的参数，包含的局部模板使用当前页面上下文。普通项目值用 ``|e`` 转义，文档链接用 ``pathto``。硬写 "
"``chapters/reading.html`` 会在嵌套页面或其他 HTML 构建器中失效。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:101
msgid "5. Design for the reader's theme"
msgstr "5. 适应读者的主题选择"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:104
msgid ""
"Save :download:`theme.css "
"<../_static/repository/theme/_static/theme.css>` as "
"``orbit/_static/theme.css``:"
msgstr ""
"将 :download:`theme.css <../_static/repository/theme/_static/theme.css>` "
"保存为 ``orbit/_static/theme.css``："

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:109
msgid "orbit/_static/theme.css"
msgstr "orbit/_static/theme.css"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:111
msgid ""
"The theme begins in light mode. The existing control selects light, dark "
"or system and saves the choice. Explicit dark rules and the system media "
"query use the same tokens. Typography and spacing stay shared. No new "
"JavaScript is needed. Avoid a fixed ink color on a background whose theme "
"can change."
msgstr ""
"默认使用浅色模式。现有控件可选择浅色、深色或跟随系统，并保存选择。显式深色规则和系统媒体查询使用相同变量，排版和间距共用。无须添加 "
"JavaScript。背景会变时，不要将文字固定为不适应主题的颜色。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:116
msgid ""
"Browser hyphenation follows the page language. It is not Typst's "
"paragraph optimizer. The manual's optional English web optimizer is "
"described separately in :doc:`../topics/typography`; this example uses "
"native browser layout."
msgstr ""
"浏览器按页面语言断词，不等同于 Typst 的段落优化。本手册可选的英文网页优化器见 "
":doc:`../topics/typography`；本例使用浏览器原生排版。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:120
msgid ""
"Diagrams with ``:class: graphviz-adaptive`` use the selected scheme in "
"current Guidedog builds. Ordinary graphs retain their own colors. Older "
"hosts render the same DOT in its light palette. See "
":doc:`../topics/diagrams` for semantic node classes and print behavior."
msgstr ""
"当前 Guidedog 构建中，带 ``:class: graphviz-adaptive`` "
"的图会跟随所选主题。普通图保留自己的颜色，旧版主机仍能按浅色配色渲染相同 DOT。语义节点类和打印行为见 "
":doc:`../topics/diagrams`。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:125
msgid "6. Wrap the PDF book"
msgstr "6. 包装 PDF 书籍模板"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:128
msgid ""
"Save :download:`palette.typ "
"<../_static/repository/theme/_templates/palette.typ>` and "
":download:`book.typ <../_static/repository/theme/_templates/book.typ>` in "
"``orbit/_templates``. These are new files; keep ``base-book.typ`` beside "
"them."
msgstr ""
"将 :download:`palette.typ "
"<../_static/repository/theme/_templates/palette.typ>` 和 "
":download:`book.typ <../_static/repository/theme/_templates/book.typ>` "
"保存到 ``orbit/_templates``。这是两个新文件，旁边的 ``base-book.typ`` 要保留。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:134
msgid "orbit/_templates/palette.typ"
msgstr "orbit/_templates/palette.typ"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:138
msgid "orbit/_templates/book.typ"
msgstr "orbit/_templates/book.typ"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:140
msgid ""
"The host calls ``book`` with metadata and the chapter content. The "
"wrapper forwards those values to the generated base and supplies our "
"palette. Passing ``body`` into the styled function keeps its rules in "
"scope. The web stylesheet does not affect PDF; the Typst template does "
"not affect HTML."
msgstr ""
"主机将元数据和章节正文传给 ``book``。包装函数把这些参数转发给生成的基础模板，并传入配色。将 ``body`` "
"交给应用样式的函数，规则才会在正文中生效。网页 CSS 不影响 PDF，Typst 模板也不影响 HTML。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:145
msgid ""
"The base handles language-aware hyphenation and optimized line breaking. "
"The wrapper keeps those rules, uses the matching blue accent and adds "
"page numbers to document cross-references. PDF always uses the light, "
"print palette."
msgstr ""
"基础模板负责按语言断词并优化断行。包装函数保留这些规则，使用与网页相配的蓝色，并为文档交叉引用添加页码。PDF 始终采用适合打印的浅色配色。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:149
msgid "7. Build and inspect both forms"
msgstr "7. 构建并检查两种输出"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:152
msgid "Run from the same parent directory as step 1:"
msgstr "回到第一步的同一个父目录运行："

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:162
msgid ""
"Open the URL printed by ``serve``. Check the chapter and generated search "
"page, not only the front page. Try light, dark and system modes. Resize "
"the window. Use the keyboard to reach the navigation and search. Change "
"the footer partial, save, then refresh: the preview rebuilds its template "
"dependencies."
msgstr ""
"打开 ``serve`` "
"打印的网址。不只看首页，还要检查章节和生成的搜索页面。尝试浅色、深色及系统模式，缩放窗口，用键盘操作导航和搜索。修改页脚局部模板，保存并刷新，预览服务会重建依赖它的页面。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:167
msgid ""
"Open ``orbit/_build/pdf/orbit-notes-en.pdf`` in a PDF reader. Guidedog "
"adds the language suffix to the configured filename. Inspect the "
"contents, chapter opening, equation, table, code and diagram. Look for "
"clipped labels, loose paragraphs and missing glyphs. The other outputs "
"are below ``_build/html``, ``_build/dirhtml`` and ``_build/singlehtml``. "
"Stop the server with ``Ctrl+C``."
msgstr ""
"在 PDF 阅读器中打开 ``orbit/_build/pdf/orbit-notes-en.pdf``。Guidedog "
"会在配置的文件名后添加语言后缀。检查目录、章节首页、公式、表格、代码和图示，留意裁切、松散行距和缺字。其他输出位于 "
"``_build/html``、``_build/dirhtml`` 和 ``_build/singlehtml``。用 ``Ctrl+C`` "
"停止服务器。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:174
msgid "8. Reuse and maintain the theme"
msgstr "8. 复用和维护主题"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:177
msgid ""
"Create another project with ``guidedog quickstart``. Copy the finished "
"``_templates`` directory and ``_static/theme.css`` into it. Add "
"``html_css_files = [\"theme.css\"]``, the accent option and the "
"``edition_label`` context value to its configuration. Change the footer's "
"document link to a page that exists in that project. Keep the new "
"project's metadata and source tree."
msgstr ""
"用 ``guidedog quickstart`` 创建另一个项目，将完成的 ``_templates`` 目录和 "
"``_static/theme.css`` 复制过去。在配置中加入 ``html_css_files = "
"[\"theme.css\"]``、强调色选项和 ``edition_label`` "
"上下文值。将页脚文档链接改为新项目中存在的页面，保留新项目自己的元数据和源文件。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:183
msgid ""
"The copied PDF base makes the theme self-contained. When upgrading "
"Guidedog, create a scratch quickstart project and compare its templates "
"with your saved base. Adopt the changes you need, then rebuild every "
"target. The built-in HTML layout can evolve too; small block overrides "
"are easier to maintain than a second complete layout. For every variable "
"and block, see :doc:`../templates`."
msgstr ""
"复制的 PDF 基础模板让主题自包含。升级 Guidedog 时，创建临时 quickstart "
"项目，将新模板与保存的基础模板比较，按需合入修改，再重建所有目标。内置 HTML "
"布局也会演变；少量块覆盖比另一整套布局更易维护。变量和块的完整说明见 :doc:`../templates`。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-custom-theme.rst:189
msgid ""
"If the build reports a missing ``base-book.typ``, finish the rename in "
"step 1. If the label is blank, set ``edition_label`` in ``html_context``. "
"If CSS is missing, check both ``html_static_path`` and "
"``html_css_files``. Read the file, line and correction in the diagnostic "
"before changing unrelated settings."
msgstr ""
"若报告缺少 ``base-book.typ``，完成第一步的重命名。标签为空时，在 ``html_context`` 中设置 "
"``edition_label``。CSS 缺失时，同时检查 ``html_static_path`` 和 "
"``html_css_files``。先阅读诊断中的文件、行号和修正建议，再调整相关设置。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:1
msgid "Make a small book"
msgstr "制作一本小书"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:4
msgid ""
"A website is an interconnected web of pages that readers explore "
"non-linearly. A book, by contrast, requires a deliberate, sequential "
"reading order with numbered chapters, running headers, and formal front "
"matter."
msgstr "网站允许读者通过链接自由浏览；书籍则需要明确的顺序、章节编号、页眉和前置页。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:8
msgid ""
"In Guidedog, the table of contents directive (``toctree``) provides the "
"bridge between both formats. A single ``toctree`` organizes your "
"documents into a hierarchical sidebar tree for the web and a linear "
"chapter progression for the PDF book."
msgstr "Guidedog 用目录指令 ``toctree`` 连接两种形式：同一棵树既构成网页侧栏，也决定 PDF 的线性章节顺序。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:14
msgid ""
"The root document toctree maps into an interactive sidebar and "
"breadcrumbs on the web, and numbered chapters in print."
msgstr "根文档的 toctree 在网页中形成交互导航和面包屑，在打印版中形成编号章节。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:14
msgid ""
"How a single toctree shapes both web navigation and sequential book "
"chapters."
msgstr "同一个 toctree 同时决定网页导航和书籍章节顺序。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:35
msgid "1. Add a new chapter"
msgstr "1. 添加新章节"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:38
msgid ""
"In your ``notes`` project, create a new document named "
"``measurement.rst``:"
msgstr "在 ``notes`` 项目中创建 ``measurement.rst``："

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:41
msgid "notes/measurement.rst"
msgstr "notes/measurement.rst"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:64
msgid ""
"Notice the section label ``.. _measurement-units:`` placed directly above "
"the heading. Labels establish cross-reference targets that work "
"identically on the web and in print."
msgstr "注意标题上方的 ``.. _measurement-units:``。标签定义交叉引用目标，在网页和打印版中均有效。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:67
msgid "2. Structure the reading order"
msgstr "2. 组织阅读顺序"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:70
msgid "Open ``notes/index.rst`` and declare the table of contents:"
msgstr "打开 ``notes/index.rst``，声明目录："

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:73
msgid "notes/index.rst"
msgstr "notes/index.rst"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:92
msgid "Understanding the toctree options:"
msgstr "toctree 选项说明："

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:94
msgid ""
"``:maxdepth: 2`` sets the depth of nested subheadings displayed in the "
"table of contents."
msgstr "``:maxdepth: 2`` 设置目录中展示的子标题深度。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:95
msgid ""
"``:numbered:`` activates automatic, hierarchical chapter numbering (for "
"example, \"1. Measurement\" and \"1.1 Units of measurement\")."
msgstr ""
"``:numbered:`` 开启分层章节编号，如“1. Measurement”和“1.1 Units of measurement”。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:96
msgid ""
"``measurement`` references the document file name without the ``.rst`` "
"extension."
msgstr "``measurement`` 引用文档名，不带 ``.rst`` 扩展名。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:98
msgid "Cross-referencing syntax:"
msgstr "交叉引用语法："

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:100
msgid "``:doc:`measurement``` links to the chapter by document path."
msgstr "``:doc:`measurement``` 按文档路径链接到章节。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:101
msgid ""
"``:ref:`measurement-units``` links to the labeled section. PDF uses the "
"section title. A book template can also add the page number through "
"``page-ref``; see :doc:`a-custom-theme` for a working example."
msgstr ""
"``:ref:`measurement-units``` 链接到带标签的节。PDF 显示节标题；书籍模板还能通过 ``page-ref`` "
"添加页码，可用示例见 :doc:`a-custom-theme`。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:105
msgid "3. Add a diagram with Graphviz"
msgstr "3. 添加 Graphviz 图示"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:108
msgid ""
"Visual diagrams clarify complex relationships. Guidedog embeds the "
"Graphviz engine natively, compiling vector diagrams directly into SVG for "
"web pages and PDF drawings for print without requiring an external "
"browser renderer."
msgstr "图示能说明复杂关系。Guidedog 原生集成 Graphviz，为网页生成 SVG，为打印版嵌入矢量图，无须外部浏览器渲染器。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:112
msgid "Add a diagram to ``notes/measurement.rst``:"
msgstr "在 ``notes/measurement.rst`` 中添加图示："

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:135
msgid ""
"The ``:caption:`` option supplies a caption. To number figures, add "
"``numfig = true`` to ``notes/conf.toml``. The ``:alt:`` option provides "
"alternative text for screen readers."
msgstr ""
"``:caption:`` 提供图注。需要编号时，在 ``notes/conf.toml`` 加入 ``numfig = "
"true``。``:alt:`` 为屏幕阅读器提供替代文本。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:139
msgid "4. Build the book and inspect results"
msgstr "4. 构建并检查书籍"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:142
msgid "Rebuild your project:"
msgstr "重新构建项目："

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:149
msgid "Inspect the results in both formats:"
msgstr "分别检查两种输出："

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:151
msgid ""
"**HTML website:** Open ``notes/_build/html/index.html``. The sidebar now "
"shows the numbered chapter hierarchy. Clicking \"1. Measurement\" opens "
"the new page, complete with local breadcrumbs and the rendered SVG "
"diagram."
msgstr ""
"**HTML 网站：** 打开 ``notes/_build/html/index.html``。侧栏显示编号章节层级，点击“1. "
"Measurement”可打开含面包屑和 SVG 图示的新页面。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:154
msgid ""
"**PDF book:** Open ``notes/_build/pdf/field-notes-en.pdf``. The contents "
"lists the chapters and their pages. The diagram remains vector artwork, "
"and document cross-references link to their targets."
msgstr ""
"**PDF 书籍：** 打开 "
"``notes/_build/pdf/field-notes-en.pdf``。目录列出章节和页码，图示保持矢量形式，文档交叉引用链接到对应位置。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:158
msgid "5. Next steps"
msgstr "5. 下一步"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:161
msgid ""
"Now that you understand the dual output model, explore the topics section "
"to learn more:"
msgstr "理解两种输出后，可继续阅读专题："

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:163
msgid "Learn rich markup, lists, and tables in :doc:`../topics/writing`."
msgstr "丰富标记、列表和表格见 :doc:`../topics/writing`。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:164
msgid ""
"Learn how to render formulas and equations in "
":doc:`../topics/mathematics`."
msgstr "公式与方程排版见 :doc:`../topics/mathematics`。"

#: ../../tutorial/a-small-book.rst:165
msgid ""
"Learn how to configure custom styles and book fonts in "
":doc:`../topics/typography`."
msgstr "自定义样式和书籍字体见 :doc:`../topics/typography`。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:1
msgid "Your first project"
msgstr "第一个项目"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:4
msgid ""
"This tutorial guides you through creating, writing, and building your "
"first documentation project with Guidedog. The goal is modest and clear: "
"start from a clean directory, generate both an HTML website and a "
"printable PDF book from the same source file, and experience the live "
"preview server."
msgstr "本教程从空目录开始，创建并编写一个 Guidedog 项目，用同一源文件生成 HTML 网站和可打印的 PDF，再体验实时预览服务。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:9
msgid ""
"You need a working installation of Guidedog. For PDF output, Guidedog can "
"use its embedded compiler or an installed Typst binary (0.15.1 or newer). "
"See :doc:`../howto/install`."
msgstr ""
"需要先安装 Guidedog。PDF 可使用内嵌编译器，或已安装的 Typst 0.15.1 及更新版本。见 "
":doc:`../howto/install`。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:12
msgid "On macOS, you can install the official release using Homebrew:"
msgstr "macOS 可通过 Homebrew 安装官方版本："

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:18
msgid "Project architecture and build pipeline"
msgstr "项目结构与构建流程"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:21
msgid ""
"Guidedog takes a single directory of source files and compiles it into "
"two distinct artifacts: a responsive HTML website and a typeset PDF book."
msgstr "Guidedog 将一个源目录构建为两种产物：响应式 HTML 网站和排版好的 PDF 书籍。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:26
msgid ""
"Project sources and templates pass through the Guidedog compiler to "
"produce HTML and PDF artifacts."
msgstr "项目源文件和模板通过 Guidedog 编译器生成 HTML 和 PDF。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:26
msgid "How Guidedog compiles a project into an HTML website and a PDF book."
msgstr "Guidedog 将项目构建为 HTML 网站与 PDF 书籍的过程。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:46
msgid "1. Create the project"
msgstr "1. 创建项目"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:49
msgid ""
"Run the ``quickstart`` command from a folder where the target directory "
"``notes`` does not yet exist:"
msgstr "在目标目录 ``notes`` 尚不存在的父目录中运行 ``quickstart``："

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:56
msgid "Guidedog creates a complete, self-contained project structure:"
msgstr "Guidedog 创建完整、自包含的项目结构："

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:74
msgid "Understanding the files:"
msgstr "文件说明："

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:76
msgid ""
"``conf.toml``: Project settings (title, author, version, language, "
"builders)."
msgstr "``conf.toml``：项目名称、作者、版本、语言和构建器等设置。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:77
msgid ""
"``index.rst``: The root document that defines your front page and table "
"of contents."
msgstr "``index.rst``：定义首页和目录的根文档。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:78
msgid "``_templates/layout.html``: The HTML website template (Jinja)."
msgstr "``_templates/layout.html``：HTML 网站的 Jinja 布局。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:79
msgid ""
"``_templates/book.typ``: The PDF book layout and typography template "
"(Typst)."
msgstr "``_templates/book.typ``：PDF 书籍的 Typst 布局、字体和封面。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:80
msgid "``_static/``: CSS stylesheets and JavaScript enhancements."
msgstr "``_static/``：CSS 样式和 JavaScript 增强功能。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:81
msgid ""
"``assets/``: Dedicated folders for project images, diagrams, audio, and "
"video files."
msgstr "``assets/``：存放项目图片、图示、音频和视频的目录。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:83
msgid ""
"Templates in Guidedog are directly visible and editable. They are placed "
"directly inside your project rather than hidden within an external theme "
"or system cache. You can modify them at any time to customize your site "
"and book design. The first build creates ``_build`` for generated output."
msgstr ""
"模板是项目中可直接查看和编辑的文件，不藏在外部主题或系统缓存中。随时可以修改网站与书籍设计。首次构建会创建存放输出的 ``_build``。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:88
msgid "2. Write the first page"
msgstr "2. 编写第一页"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:91
msgid ""
"Open ``notes/index.rst`` in your editor and replace its contents with the "
"following:"
msgstr "在编辑器中打开 ``notes/index.rst``，替换为以下内容："

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:113
msgid ""
"This page demonstrates headings, mathematical notation, and an admonition "
"note."
msgstr "此页演示标题、数学记号和提示块。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:115
msgid "3. Build and inspect the outputs"
msgstr "3. 构建并检查输出"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:118
msgid "Compile your project into both HTML and PDF formats:"
msgstr "将项目同时构建为 HTML 和 PDF："

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:125
msgid ""
"The ``-W`` flag instructs Guidedog to treat warnings as errors. Keeping "
"this flag enabled in your routine checks ensures that broken references "
"or markup errors are caught early."
msgstr "``-W`` 将警告视为错误。日常检查开启它，能及早发现引用或标记问题。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:128
msgid "Now inspect the output files:"
msgstr "查看输出文件："

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:130
msgid ""
"Open ``notes/_build/html/index.html`` in your web browser. You will see a "
"clean, responsive documentation website with a theme switch, search bar, "
"and formatted math."
msgstr "在浏览器中打开 ``notes/_build/html/index.html``，查看响应式文档网站的主题切换、搜索框和数学排版。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:132
msgid ""
"Open the PDF file generated in ``notes/_build/pdf/``. You will see a book "
"layout complete with running headers, page numbers, and typographic math."
msgstr "打开 ``notes/_build/pdf/`` 中生成的 PDF，检查书籍布局、页眉、页码和公式。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:135
msgid ""
"Guidedog formats mathematics appropriately for each medium: using "
"client-side MathJax for the browser, and native vector formulas for the "
"Typst PDF engine."
msgstr "网页用客户端 MathJax 排版公式，Typst PDF 引擎则生成原生矢量公式。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:138
msgid "4. Live preview and incremental rebuilds"
msgstr "4. 实时预览与增量构建"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:141
msgid "Guidedog includes a built-in development web server:"
msgstr "Guidedog 内置开发预览服务器："

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:147
msgid ""
"The terminal prints a local URL, such as ``http://localhost:8000``. Open "
"this address in your browser."
msgstr "终端会打印本机网址，例如 ``http://localhost:8000``。在浏览器中打开它。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:150
msgid "Now test the live editing loop:"
msgstr "试一下编辑与预览循环："

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:154
msgid ""
"Editing and saving a file triggers timestamp verification and selective "
"rebuild upon refreshing the browser."
msgstr "编辑并保存后，刷新浏览器会检查时间戳并选择性重建。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:154
msgid "The live development cycle with guidedog serve."
msgstr "guidedog serve 的实时开发循环。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:173
msgid "Edit ``notes/index.rst`` to add a new paragraph."
msgstr "编辑 ``notes/index.rst``，添加一段文字。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:174
msgid "Save the file."
msgstr "保存文件。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:175
msgid "Refresh your browser page."
msgstr "刷新浏览器页面。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:177
msgid ""
"Before serving a requested page, Guidedog checks file modification "
"timestamps against its cached build environment. If inputs have changed, "
"it rebuilds only the affected documents before responding to the browser "
"request."
msgstr "提供页面前，Guidedog 会比较输入文件的修改时间与缓存记录；若有变化，先重建受影响的文档，再响应请求。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:181
msgid ""
"When you run a build without modifying any files, Guidedog reuses the "
"cached document trees, avoiding redundant re-parsing."
msgstr "没有修改文件时，Guidedog 会复用缓存的文档树，避免重复解析。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:184
msgid ""
"Press ``Ctrl+C`` in your terminal to stop the server when you are done."
msgstr "完成后在终端按 ``Ctrl+C`` 停止服务器。"

#: ../../tutorial/first-project.rst:186
msgid ""
"Continue to :doc:`a-small-book` to learn how to organize multiple "
"chapters and cross-references."
msgstr "接着阅读 :doc:`a-small-book`，学习组织多章文档和交叉引用。"

